<text xml:space="preserve"><note-content version="0.1"><underline>New Note 2026-08-25 23:29:11.675</underline>

v7 testing

#1 volume bar broken if forced to a specific position through random clicking in the whole bar: applies volume change, but bar returns to previous position (volume remains changed)
#2 volume bar wheel scroll OK, , but applies volume change from visual position, instead the volume applied by #1.
#3 pause button glyph is bigger than all others, so paused state "deforms" the ui
#4 time info change on click ok!
#5 time info too wide. it can be: elaped
                               <list><list-item dir="ltr">------</list-item></list>
                                 remaining
#6 bottom status bar, add total playlist time alongside central "#current/total" info
#5 general UI distribution feels ok, don't change that for now.
#6 theme changer OK! let's do it a switchable thematic (moon) or (sun) emoji or jetbrains char.
#7 󰮯  Consume icon?
#8 info box looks fine
#8 response is superb. it even synchronizes with mpDris2 - mako notifications in "real time" -&gt; very fast track changes, info never lags. ui never freezes. -&gt; this' going the right track

</note-content></text>
